# Licensing

## Synthetic dataset

Random Dot Stereo Club v1 by Kennosuke Kurokawa is released under the Creative
Commons Attribution 4.0 International license (CC BY 4.0), as specified in
the [Zenodo record](https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.24564844). The same terms
apply to the corresponding synthetic sample data, calibration files, and
shared meshes distributed in this repository.

Suggested attribution: Kennosuke Kurokawa, *Random Dot Stereo Club — Synthetic
Active Stereo Dataset*, v1, https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.24564844.

[CC BY 4.0 legal text](https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/legalcode)

## Skoltech3D comparison figure

`samples/skoltech3d-balancing-board-comparison.png` incorporates material
from Skoltech3D by Oleg Voynov et al. (CVPR 2023). The figure is shared under
Creative Commons Attribution-NonCommercial 4.0 International (CC BY-NC 4.0).
The figure contains rectified and cropped views, and the depth panels are
colorized and masked to the valid scan region.

[Skoltech3D source and license](https://skoltech3d.appliedai.tech/#license) ·
[CC BY-NC 4.0 legal text](https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc/4.0/legalcode)

